 "kind": "statement",
 "title": "Identity and cocycle laws for affine restriction",
 "statement": "The restriction isomorphism is the identity for $s=1$, and its two possible\ncomposites on an iterated basic open $D(st)$ agree literally after the\nchosen canonical associativity isomorphisms.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-nagata-compactification/sk-def-nagata-sketch-data/lemma-nagata-affine-blowup-restrict-cocycle.md",
